    title: "Test workers oversubscribe CPU: each xdist worker runs torch inference with an all-cores OpenMP pool; OMP_NUM_THREADS=1 cuts the full suite 45:49 -> 35:16"  # 9e17
    status: todo_soft  # 9e17
    priority: 2  # 9e17
